<title>UK: Reichhold Finance sets 10 bln yen four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Reichhold Finance sets 10 bln yen four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Morgan Stanley and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REICHHOLD FINANCE USA INC</p>
<p> KEEPWELL AGREEMENT WITH DAINIPPON INK CHEMICALS INC</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     1.60	MATURITY    18.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.525   PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M)  100</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.0	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
